results/WAVE4/H50/close_march.py is a byte-for-byte copy of results/WAVE2/F2/close_march.py
(both sha256 2e0975aa98c7dbcc2cf535993b54f57db764f7bf50f64fc54b9ff2860e67c855); diff is empty.
Checked by reading the copy:
(a) every march_cu job (march(), line 39) and every CaDiCaL+cake_lpr job (solve(), line 83) runs in
    its own tempfile.mkdtemp directory under WORK, removed afterwards.
(b) finalize() (lines 134-142) writes leaves.icnf and open.icnf with tempfile.mkstemp in the output
    directory and os.replace into place.
(c) when leaves.jsonl does not exist, the first record is {"case": --name, "case_sha256": sha256 of
    the case CNF} (lines 117-119); run with --name U_L6.
Also: a leaf is written to leaves.icnf only if cake_lpr printed exactly "s VERIFIED UNSAT" (BUG-1),
other UNSAT verdicts are recorded as UNSAT_UNCHECKED and stay open.
